 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# TATA Group - AI Legal Document Intelligence System (Google Colab)\n",
    "\n",
    "Run this notebook to launch the full system in Colab and open it in your browser via a public URL.\n",
    "\n",
    "**No API key needed** - the built-in offline AI engine powers the whole pipeline. Optionally add a free Gemini key below."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 1. Install dependencies"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!pip install -q fastapi uvicorn pydantic python-dotenv pymupdf python-multipart google-generativeai\n",
    "print('dependencies installed')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 2. Get the code\n\nTwo options:\n- **(A)** Clone from GitHub (public repo URL), or\n- **(B)** upload the project zip / files into `/content/tata-ai-legal-document-intelligence-system`"]
  ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# (A) Uncomment and set your repo URL:\n",
    "# REPO_URL = 'https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/tata-ai-legal-document-intelligence-system'\n",
    "# !git clone {REPO_URL} && cd tata-ai-legal-document-intelligence-system\n",
    "\n",
    "# (B) Or upload files (after running this, use the file uploader on the left panel):\n",
    "from google.colab import files\n",
    "import os\n",
    "if not os.path.exists('/content/tata-ai-legal-document-intelligence-system/backend/main.py'):\n",
    "    print('Upload your project zip (e.g. tata-ai-legal-document-intelligence-system.zip):')\n",
    "    uploaded = files.upload()\n",
    "    for name in uploaded:\n",
    "        if name.endswith('.zip'):\n",
    "            !unzip -q {name} -d /content/\n",
    "print('project ready')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 3. Environment (optional Gemini key)\n\nSet `GEMINI_API_KEY` if you have one (free from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey). Leave empty to use the offline engine."]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "os.environ['AI_MODE'] = 'auto'\n",
    "os.environ['GEMINI_API_KEY'] = ''   # <-- paste your key here if you have one\n",
    "os.chdir('/content/tata-ai-legal-document-intelligence-system')\n",
    "print('env ready', os.getcwd())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 4. Start the server in the background"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import threading, subprocess, sys, time\n",
    "\n",
    "def run_server():\n",
    "    subprocess.Popen([sys.executable, '-m', 'uvicorn', 'backend.main:app', '--host', '0.0.0.0', '--port', '8000'],\n",
    "                     cwd='/content/tata-ai-legal-document-intelligence-system')\n",
    "\n",
    "threading.Thread(target=run_server, daemon=True).start()\n",
    "time.sleep(6)\n",
    "\n",
    "import requests\n",
    "r = requests.get('http://localhost:8000/api/health')\n",
    "print('server health:', r.json())\n",
    "print('AI mode:', r.json().get('ai_mode'))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 5. Get a public URL (ngrok)\n\nOptional - use only if you want to share the demo link from Colab."]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!pip install -q pyngrok\n",
    "from pyngrok import ngrok\n",
    "\n",
    "# Get a free authtoken at https://dashboard.ngrok.com and paste it here (optional):\n",
    "# ngrok.set_auth_token('YOUR_NGROK_TOKEN')\n",
    "\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    public_url = ngrok.connect(8000)\n",
    "    print('PUBLIC URL ->', public_url)\n",
    "except Exception as e:\n",
    "    print('ngrok not configured - use http://localhost:8000 (or run in Colab with the localhost link button)')\n",
    "    print('note:', e)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Use the system\n",
    "\n",
    "- Open the URL above (or localhost:8000 if running locally).\n",
    "- Login: **admin@tata.com** / **tata123**\n",
    "- Upload `data/sample_contracts/vendor_agreement_sample.txt` and watch the pipeline.\n",
    "\n",
    "## 7. (Optional) Pre-load sample documents\n"
